---
const baseUrl = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---

<section class="guarantee-section scene-transition" id="garantia" aria-labelledby="guarantee-title">
  <div class="container">
    <article class="guarantee-shell reveal reveal-soft">
      <div class="guarantee-seal reveal reveal-scale delay-1">
        <img
          src={`${baseUrl}assets/7-dias-garantia.webp`}
          alt="Selo de 7 dias de garantia"
          width="336"
          height="336"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="guarantee-copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">7 DIAS DE GARANTIA</span>
        <h2 id="guarantee-title">Conheça o treinamento antes de decidir se quer permanecer com ele.</h2>
        <p>Após a compra, você terá 7 dias para acessar o conteúdo e avaliar se o treinamento faz sentido para você.</p>
        <p>Caso decida que não deseja continuar, poderá solicitar o reembolso dentro do período da garantia.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .guarantee-section {
    padding: clamp(58px, 6vw, 78px) 0;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #EEF7FA 0%, #F8FCFD 100%);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(24, 181, 200, 0.1);
  }

  .guarantee-shell {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 168px minmax(0, 1fr);
    align-items: center;
    gap: clamp(28px, 4.5vw, 52px);
    max-width: 940px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(28px, 4vw, 42px);
    background:
      linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9), rgba(232, 248, 250, 0.68)),
      rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.74);
    border: 1px solid rgba(24, 181, 200, 0.2);
    border-radius: var(--radius-card);
    box-shadow: 0 22px 48px -40px rgba(2, 11, 39, 0.46);
  }

  .guarantee-seal {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 168px;
    height: 168px;
  }

  .guarantee-seal img {
    display: block;
    width: 154px;
    height: 154px;
    object-fit: contain;
    filter: drop-shadow(0 12px 16px rgba(12, 38, 88, 0.12));
  }

  .guarantee-copy h2 {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin: 13px 0 16px;
    color: var(--color-navy-700);
    font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 34px);
    line-height: 1.18;
  }

  .guarantee-copy p {
    max-width: 66ch;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.58;
  }

  .guarantee-copy p + p {
    margin-top: 8px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 680px) {
    .guarantee-section {
      padding: 54px 0 60px;
    }

    .guarantee-shell {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 28px 22px 30px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .guarantee-seal {
      width: 132px;
      height: 132px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .guarantee-seal img {
      width: 124px;
      height: 124px;
    }

    .guarantee-copy h2 {
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(23px, 7vw, 29px);
    }

    .guarantee-copy p {
      font-size: 14.5px;
    }
  }
</style>
